  "tokens": 125,
  "cover_text": "When people ask me what my favorite horror film is, I always say \"Family Awards\". It's the last horror film that's still fresh in my memory from my childhood, the one I still can't put down.\n\nI'm not entirely saying that a famous horror film can't be good, if we ask for \"good\" I mean not necessarily \"bad\" quality, but not necessarily good. I should of course say that I like many really bad films that can't be worse than others of importance.\n\nAnd I do say that I really like some films from Voyager, but I think one of the best is considered to be this film, titled \"睽违多年\"",
